{"id":"vod_sn_38753","vodId":"38753","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"命运之夜","name_cn":"命运之夜","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/4f9c13224f971618f218892c7daa7686.jpg"},"summary":"十年前，几乎毁灭世界的大灾难中，卫宫士郎被魔术师卫宫切嗣所救，成为其养子。　　十年后，士郎为履行与已故的养父之间的约定——成为“正义的伙伴”，而每日不停的进行魔术锻炼。　　偶然的一天，士郎被卷入了称为“圣杯战争”的魔术师之间的对决。规则是一位魔术师与一位“英灵”结成契约。所谓“圣杯战争”，胜利者可以获得圣杯来实现任何愿望。于是，七位魔术师与七位“英灵”一起加入了这个为了创造奇迹的厮杀之中。　　卫宫士郎深知，十年前的那场大灾难就是“圣杯战争”引起的，为了避免悲剧再次发生，他与自己的“英灵”Sabar一起，投身于这充满危险与艰辛的”圣杯战争”之中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:04:21","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dgFCSZf9NA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SRaHUBKnHn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/w3PKaQkYeK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/C68gRGe8TS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/r9rm2p59eC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JLhz1Pu6eH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bTUtnJDE5n1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kV4hWqmzki1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9Ck7AfBJwe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/L4U9ZDDqWG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tpqTeCNJeS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dvU0kycweh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/t02ymdyuLm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/a29Dg0RmCj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https